Applications are open until the end of November. The role is based in Porto Celeste, with travel to clients in several countries.

We are looking for a junior consultant who enjoys detailed work and talking with people on the shop floor. You will support projects in operations, reporting and software selection, and you will learn from senior consultants on site and in the studio.

## What you will do

- Collect and check process data with client teams
- Build spreadsheets and simple dashboards for workshops
- Write clear notes and summaries after each meeting
- Prepare workshop materials with a senior colleague

## What we offer

A structured first year with a named mentor, a clear training plan and regular feedback. You will work in a small team, and you will see the results of your work quickly. We pay a fair salary, cover public transport and offer a flexible working week.

## What you need

A degree or equivalent experience in business, engineering or a related field. You write well, you are comfortable with spreadsheets, and you like to ask why. A second language is an advantage, especially for travel.

To apply, send a short letter and your CV to [hello@harborlane.example](mailto:hello@harborlane.example).
